{
 "about": "Customizations of the uploaded sets through POST /access/v1/config/customization/import (the case field customize): replace, replace with some fields only, disable, and add, of a set, a nested set, a policy and a rule, addressed at the top and through the path of their parents; the import errors; two levels; two imports at one level. Each case asks before any import and after each one; its read rule allows READ and its update rule never holds, so each answer shows which node the import reached. The import golden is the import's status. The runner deletes the case's customizations before its upload and after its last step.",
